        {
            "title": "道指跌237點納指彈逾1%   晶片股急升  AMD揚11%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美股收市個別發展，納斯達克指數反彈264點或約1.1%，收報24,579點。道瓊斯工業平均指數表現偏軟。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/08/53179dc1c0148c5afeb47379b8f5b5c5_Financial_Markets_Wall_Street_724_8_FB.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/08/53179dc1c0148c5afeb47379b8f5b5c5_Financial_Markets_Wall_Street_724_8_FB.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">道瓊斯指數低開444點後，跌幅擴大至最多530點，低見50992點，之後跌幅反覆降低近一半，最終收報51,285點，跌237點，跌幅約0.5%。周四道指狠瀉1833點。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">標普500指數收報7,376點，升23點或0.3%。一度上揚1.23%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">納斯達克指數收升264點或1.09%，報24,579。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美國公布10月非農業新增職位達16.5萬個，表現遠好過市場預期。同期失業率出乎意料降至4.1%，市場對聯儲局下月加息的預期再度升溫。由於美股上日急挫，吸引資金趁低吸納近期弱勢股份，帶動科技股重拾升軌。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">多隻晶片、光通信及AI相關股份大幅回升，刺激費城半導體指數強勁反彈4.21%。英特爾升7.71%、AMD揚11.04%、Coherent飛升13.58%；SpaceX亦急升8.62%，英偉達則升2.78%，為表現最強道指成份股。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">不過，部分科技股表現仍然受壓，蘋果及微軟收市微跌不足1%，希捷科技與西部數據均跌逾1%，金融股與消費股走勢同樣偏軟。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">總結全星期表現，美股三大指數全線報跌。道指全周累跌逾0.9%，錄得連續兩星期跌勢；標普500指數及納指則雙雙錄得連續四個星期下跌，本周分別累跌約2.7%及約3.4%，費城半導體指數大瀉12.4%，金龍中國指數急揚8.3%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17134039-%e9%81%93%e6%8c%87%e8%b7%8c237%e9%bb%9e%e7%b4%8d%e6%8c%87%e5%bd%88%e9%80%be1-%e6%99%b6%e7%89%87%e8%82%a1%e6%80%a5%e5%8d%87-amd%e6%8f%9a11",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/06/b5e10863b81cb1d6399f688ad8885c46_Financial_Markets_Wall_Street__85_3_FB.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-07 11:16:08",
