        {
            "title": "A股收跌創板跌4%  全周計滬深俱報升",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A股全日跌，中午休市時多家AI公司發公告稱回購股份，惟市況依然疲弱，創板收跌近4%，深股跌近2.6%，惟一周計滬股升逾2%，深股升逾3%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20240307_FI_source-ap_AShare-8.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20240307_FI_source-ap_AShare-8.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬綜指全日收報3,649，跌40點或1.08%，今早開跌77點或2.08%，報3,612，早段見3,610，跌79點或2.14%，其後跌幅收窄，最高報3,660，跌幅收窄至29點或0.78%，為半日低位，全日成交7,726.35億元(人民幣‧下同)。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深成指全日跌295點或2.57%，報11,175，今早開跌427點或3.72%，報11,231。低見11,044，挫427點或3.72%，全日成交8,851.59億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬深300收報4,054，跌59點或1.44%，今早開跌96點或2.33%，報4,017。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">創業板指數收跌101點或3.96%，報2,465，今早開跌128點或4.98%，報2,438。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬股全周累升50點或1.38% ; 深成指全周升342點或3.15%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17129745-a%e8%82%a1%e6%94%b6%e8%b7%8c%e5%89%b5%e6%9d%bf%e8%b7%8c4-%e5%85%a8%e5%91%a8%e8%a8%88%e6%bb%ac%e6%b7%b1%e4%bf%b1%e5%a0%b1%e5%8d%87",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20250408_FI_source-ap_AShare-2.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-06 15:32:51",
