            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股午後跌勢持續，恒生指數較早時低見24,483點，跌313點，跌幅1.26%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">科技指數同步受壓，報4,073點，跌80點，跌幅1.94%。</p>\n</div>",
